flowchart LR
  T([task]) --> B[orchestrator<br/>/dev-loop:run<br/>writes the brief]
  B --> I[implementer<br/>Opus, TDD]
  I --> G{gate<br/>tests · lint · build<br/>weakening.sh}
  G -- fails --> I
  G -- passes --> S[scan.sh<br/>Semgrep · gitleaks<br/>+ mutation]
  S --> R[reviewer<br/>Opus]
  S --> C[critic<br/>Sonnet]
  S --> X[security reviewer<br/>sensitive paths only]
  R --> D{all approve?}
  C --> D
  X --> D
  D -- yes --> OK([report · git snapshot · history])
  D -- blocking findings --> F[refiner<br/>Sonnet, smallest diff]
  F --> G
  D -- round limit or stuck --> E([escalate to a person<br/>with a proposed split])
